OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over future 'rabbit
OL,4,Ahutches'-sized homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe minimum home size in Jersey could
OL,7,Fget smaller as the government reviews
OL,8,Fhousing standards.
OL,10,FCurrently, the minimum space standard
OL,11,Ffor a one-bedroom apartment is 43sq m
OL,12,F(465sq ft), compared with 37sq m (400sq
OL,13,Fft) in England. People have been asked
OL,14,Ffor feedback about changing the policy,
OL,15,Fwhich politicians said they hoped would
OL,16,Fgive greater flexibility for "more
OL,17,Faffordable" homes.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
