OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over future 'rabbit
OL,4,Ahutches'-sized homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhat smaller size homes could be has
OL,7,Fnot been specified, but Planning
OL,8,FMinister Sir Mark Boleat said: "We want
OL,9,Fto say you've got an option of sharing
OL,10,Fbut also you've got the option of
OL,11,Fhaving your own very small unit."
OL,13,FReform Jersey has warned against an
OL,14,Funsuitable "glut of properties" the
OL,15,Fsize of "rabbit hutches".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
